            {
              "explain": "Use the compound interest formula \\(A = P(1+R)^n\\).",
              "work": "A = 20000(1 + 0.055)^8"
            },
            {
              "explain": "Calculate the result.",
              "work": "A = 20000(1.055)^8 \\approx 30693.308"
